{"id": "index-ml-basics", "question": "What ML basics are summarised in the index note — learning types and project types?", "expected": "ML pipeline: feature -> function(feature) -> output. Supervised (labelled) vs unsupervised (self classification/clustering), semi-supervised (expert plus labels). Regression gives prediction (e.g. stock/crypto plus news sentiment); also category/classification, ranking, image similarities, collaborative filtering/recommendation, clustering. Project types: cognitive car = fully automatic source-to-destination self-driven; remote-control car = SONAR based.", "expectedSources": ["IEEE (INDEX)"], "tags": ["answerable"]}

